            "feedback": "Add unavailable channel `DOES_NOT_EXIST` to the track named `overview`, then set `RM` to `0.01 @ 25` without specifying measured or bottom temperature. Do not choose a substitute channel or header slot; ask for clarification and persist no mutation.",
            "expected": [
                {"path": "/sections", "operator": "length", "value": 1},
                {
                    "path": "/sections/0/tracks",
                    "operator": "not_contains_object",
